Package: ekbSeq
Title: Reusable Bulk and Single-Cell Transcriptomics Analyses
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Marc",
           family = "Bender",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "mbender1992@web.de")
Description: Reusable methods for bulk and single-cell transcriptomics,
    including differential expression contrasts, enrichment, marker
    visualization, diagnostics, and reproducible figure export. Historical
    analysis interfaces remain available for reproducibility.
